  "body": "It would be nice to have it in the spec.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately as of now, WebKit defines them in [Window](https://github.com/WebKit/webkit/blob/5cf2d3ed6657a12a51898d9bb0377aab0ef260a1/Source/WebCore/page/DOMWindow.idl#L198-L201) and [Element](https://github.com/WebKit/webkit/blob/8b95fadedc51b4dd26cfff21fe4cad6a78d84177/Source/WebCore/dom/Element.idl#L117-L120), Chrome defines them only in [Window](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/window.idl?l=206-210&rcl=7c99c02861f2916bd31d7e45a06d3a7846dc7479), Firefox defines them in [GlobalEventHandlers](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/e5327b05c822cdac24e233afa37d72c0552dbbaf/dom/webidl/EventHandler.webidl#138-141) \r\n\r\nI've filed [a Chromium bug](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=999895) and [a Firefox bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1578121).",
